Java method for LCP:
String longestCommonPrefix(String[] strs){
 if(strs==null||strs.length==0) return "";
 String prefix=strs[0];
 for(int i=1;i<strs.length;i++){
   while(strs[i].indexOf(prefix)!=0) prefix=prefix.substring(0,prefix.length()-1);
 }
 return prefix;}
Java binary search for banana‑eating speed:
int minEatingSpeed(int[] piles,int h){
 int low=1,high=*max(piles),ans=high;
 while(low<=high){
   int mid=(low+high)/2;
   if(canFinish(piles,mid,h)){ans=mid;high=mid-1;}else{low=mid+1;}
 }
 return ans;}
